  "definition": "Apprentice",
  "effectiveDate": "2025-10-17",
  "historyNote": "#10798, eff 3-18-15; ss by #13483, eff 1-9-23 (formerly Saf-Mec 102.01) (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Mec 100); #14408, eff 10-17-25",
